* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* HRCORDID
** HELP ROUTINE FOR COORDINATOR ID
**
DEFINE DATA
GLOBAL USING NRM-GL
PARAMETER
1 #USERID(A8)
END-DEFINE
SET KEY PF3
INPUT USING MAP 'HMCORID&'
IF *PF-KEY = 'PF3'
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
*
CALLNAT 'RSELUS-N' #USERID
MOVE TRUE TO G-MAP-MODIFIED
END
